`a stranger signs a sale in the dealer's name` MEANS Disposition WITH
    `the agent is a mercantile agent` IS TRUE
    `made by the agent or an authorised clerk` IS FALSE
    `the agent had actual custody` IS TRUE
    `another held the goods for the agent` IS FALSE
